flowchart TD
    Start([起始节点<br/>用户输入]):::boundary

    Voice[🎤 语音输入<br/>麦克风采集]:::boundary
    Text[📝 文本输入<br/>键盘输入]:::boundary

    ASR[🟠 ASR 语音识别<br/>FunASR paraformer-large<br/>ffmpeg → WAV 16kHz]:::ai

    Ctx[🟡 上下文管理 / 指代消解<br/>last_entity 加载<br/>最近 8 轮实体消解]:::enhance

    FSM{🟢 状态机检查<br/>当前状态?}:::logic
    FSM_IDLE[IDLE → 继续正常流程]:::logic
    FSM_CONF[AWAITING_CONFIRMATION<br/>解析 确认/取消]:::logic
    FSM_EXEC[触发 二次确认执行]:::logic
    FSM_CANCEL[回到 IDLE]:::logic
    FSM_TIMEOUT[30s 超时 → 回到 IDLE]:::logic
    FSM_BUSY[PROCESSING/REPLYING<br/>提示 正在处理]:::logic

    Rule{🟢 规则预检<br/>正则匹配?}:::logic
    Rule_HIT[命中<br/>延迟 < 50ms]:::logic
    Rule_MISS[未命中]:::logic

    LLM[🟠 LLM 大模型意图解析<br/>Ollama + qwen3:8b<br/>11 类意图 严格 JSON]:::ai
    LLM_FAIL[失败 → 无上下文重试 3 次<br/>全部失败 → unknown]:::ai

    Intent{🟢 意图执行引擎<br/>敏感操作?}:::logic
    Sensitive[是 → 二次确认]:::logic
    Direct[否 → 直接执行]:::logic

    Confirm[🟢 二次确认节点<br/>状态切到 AWAITING_CONFIRMATION<br/>等用户说 确认<br/>可在参数配置中关闭]:::logic

    Execute[🟢 业务执行<br/>DB 连接池 / 业务 API<br/>返回原始数据]:::logic

    Polish{🟡 结果润色?<br/>可选}:::enhance
    Polish_YES[是 → LLM 数据润色<br/>polish_query / summary]:::enhance
    Polish_NO[否 → 跳过<br/>直接输出]:::enhance

    Output{{🟢 前端结果输出<br/>对话气泡 + 扬声器}}:::boundary
    Bubble[💬 对话气泡<br/>文字内容]:::boundary
    Speaker[🔊 扬声器播报]:::boundary

    TTS[🟠 TTS 语音合成<br/>三引擎降级链]:::ai
    TTS1[1️⃣ sherpa-onnx VITS<br/>离线神经网络 5 音色]:::ai
    TTS2[2️⃣ Windows SAPI<br/>系统自带离线兜底]:::ai
    TTS3[3️⃣ edge-tts<br/>在线音色丰富]:::ai

    End([结束节点<br/>前端结果输出]):::boundary

    Start --> Voice
    Start --> Text
    Voice --> ASR
    Text --> Ctx
    ASR --> Ctx
    Ctx --> FSM

    FSM -->|IDLE| FSM_IDLE
    FSM -->|AWAITING_CONFIRMATION| FSM_CONF
    FSM -->|PROCESSING/REPLYING| FSM_BUSY
    FSM_CONF -->|确认| FSM_EXEC
    FSM_CONF -->|取消| FSM_CANCEL
    FSM_CONF -->|30s 超时| FSM_TIMEOUT
    FSM_IDLE --> Rule
    FSM_EXEC --> Execute
    FSM_CANCEL --> End
    FSM_TIMEOUT --> End
    FSM_BUSY --> End

    Rule -->|命中| Rule_HIT
    Rule -->|未命中| Rule_MISS
    Rule_HIT --> Intent
    Rule_MISS --> LLM
    LLM --> LLM_FAIL
    LLM_FAIL --> Intent

    Intent -->|是| Sensitive
    Intent -->|否| Direct
    Sensitive --> Confirm
    Confirm -.等待用户确认.-> FSM
    Direct --> Execute

    Execute --> Polish
    Polish -->|简单查询/导航/问候| Polish_NO
    Polish -->|复杂查询/总结| Polish_YES
    Polish_NO --> Output
    Polish_YES --> Output

    Output --> Bubble
    Output --> Speaker
    Speaker --> TTS
    TTS --> TTS1
    TTS1 -->|加载失败| TTS2
    TTS2 -->|TTS_MODE=auto| TTS3
    TTS3 --> End
    Bubble --> End

    classDef ai fill:#FFE8CC,stroke:#E8590C,stroke-width:2px,color:#7B2D00,rx:14,ry:14,font-weight:bold
    classDef logic fill:#D3F9D8,stroke:#2B8A3E,stroke-width:2px,color:#0B4F1F,rx:14,ry:14,font-weight:bold
    classDef enhance fill:#FFF3BF,stroke:#E67700,stroke-width:2px,color:#664D00,rx:14,ry:14,font-weight:bold
    classDef boundary fill:#D0EBFF,stroke:#1864AB,stroke-width:2px,color:#0B3D6E,rx:14,ry:14,font-weight:bold
